title=Space+Marines+Beginner+Army+Guide%3A+Your+First+1%2C000+Points+%282026%29&slug=space-marines-beginner-army-guide&content=%3Ch1%3ESpace+Marines+Beginner+Army+Guide%3A+Your+First+1%2C000+Points+%282026%29%3C%2Fh1%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EShort+answer%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Space+Marines+are+the+best+first+army+in+Warhammer+40K%3A+tough%2C+forgiving%2C+cheap+to+start+and+supported+by+more+tutorials+than+any+other+faction.+Build+your+first+1%2C000+points+around+a+solid+core+of+Battleline+Intercessors%2C+one+assault+unit%2C+one+vehicle+and+a+Captain.+Everything+in+the+starter+boxes+counts+%E2%80%94+nothing+is+wasted.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cblockquote+class%3D%22wp-block-quote%22%3E%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EDisclosure%3A+Grimdark+Builds+is+an+unofficial+fan+site.+Some+links+on+this+page+are+affiliate+links+%E2%80%94+if+you+buy+through+them%2C+we+may+earn+a+small+commission+at+no+extra+cost+to+you.+We+are+not+affiliated+with+or+endorsed+by+Games+Workshop.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fblockquote%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EWhy+Space+Marines+Are+the+Beginner+Army%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3EEvery+edition%2C+every+starter+box+and+half+of+all+hobby+content+on+the+internet+is+built+around+Space+Marines.+For+a+beginner%2C+that+translates+into+three+real+advantages%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Col%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ETough+on+the+table.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Good+armour+saves+and+decent+toughness+mean+your+mistakes+don%27t+delete+your+army+in+one+enemy+phase.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ECheap+and+available.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Starter+sets%2C+Combat+Patrol+boxes+and+second-hand+markets+are+flooded+with+Marines+%E2%80%94+the+easiest+army+to+buy+and+sell.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EInfinite+learning+material.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Whatever+question+you+have+%E2%80%94+painting%2C+list-building%2C+tactics+%E2%80%94+someone+has+answered+it+with+photos+and+videos.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Fol%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EYour+First+1%2C000+Points+%28Simple+Starter+List%29%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3EA+forgiving%2C+no-tricks+1%2C000-point+core+that+plays+well+while+you+learn%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cfigure+class%3D%22wp-block-table%22%3E%3Ctable%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%3EUnit%3C%2Fth%3E%3Cth%3ERole%3C%2Fth%3E%3Cth%3EWhy+It%27s+Here%3C%2Fth%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3C%2Fthead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3ECaptain+%28or+Lieutenant%29%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ELeader%2C+buffs+a+nearby+unit%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ECheap%2C+keeps+your+Battleline+fighting+harder%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3E10x+Intercessors%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EBattleline%2C+objective+holders%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EYour+workhorse%3A+durable%2C+medium+range%2C+objective-scoring%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3E5x+Assault+Intercessors%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EMelee+screen+%2F+aggression%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ETeaches+the+charge+phase+safely%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3E1x+Eradicator+squad+%283%29%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EAnti-tank+%2F+heavy+shooting%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EHandles+armour+so+you+learn+what+it+feels+like%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3E1x+Invader+ATV+or+Infiltrators%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3ESpeed+%2F+scouting%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EMovement-phase+training+wheels%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3C%2Ftbody%3E%3C%2Ftable%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cem%3EExact+point+values+shift+with+each+balance+dataslate+%E2%80%94+check+the+current+free+points+PDF+before+a+game.+The+structure+%28battleline+core+%2B+one+heavy+%2B+one+fast+unit%29+stays+correct+between+updates.%3C%2Fem%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EExpansion+path%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+at+2%2C000+points+add+a+vehicle+block+%28Redemptor-style+Dreadnought+or+Repulsor%29+and+a+second+Battleline+squad.+Buy+one+box+at+a+time+and+paint+it+before+the+next.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EPaint+Scheme%3A+Simple+and+Sharp%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3EThe+classic+mistake+is+choosing+a+scheme+with+ten+steps.+Pick+a+%3Cstrong%3Eone-colour+armour+scheme%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EBasecoat%3C%2Fstrong%3E+the+whole+model+in+your+chapter+colour+%28two+thin+coats%29%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EWash%3C%2Fstrong%3E+with+a+black+or+brown+shade+%E2%80%94+instant+depth%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EDrybrush+or+edge-highlight%3C%2Fstrong%3E+with+a+lighter+tone%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EDetails+last%3A%3C%2Fstrong%3E+gun+metal%2C+eye+lenses+%28a+dot+of+colour%29%2C+gold+on+the+shoulder+trim%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Cp%3ETwo+evenings+of+painting+gets+ten+models+done.+Save+the+freehand+banners+and+glow+effects+for+squad+number+three%2C+not+squad+number+one.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EPlaying+Your+First+Games%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3EKeep+the+army+in+a+%3Cstrong%3Ecastle+formation%3C%2Fstrong%3E+early%3A+Marines+are+durable+enough+to+hold+ground+and+shoot+%E2%80%94+the+simplest+way+to+learn+objectives.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ECharge+only+when+you%27re+sure+you%27ll+win.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Learning+melee+math+the+hard+way+is+expensive.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EScore+objectives%2C+not+kills.%3C%2Fstrong%3E+Beginners+lose+games+by+chasing+kills%3B+the+mission+rewards+standing+on+circles.%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Ch2%3ECommon+Marine+Beginner+Mistakes%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ESpreading+units+across+the+whole+board%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+Marines+win+by+concentrating+fire+and+holding+midfield%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ELeaving+the+Captain+home%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+leader+buffs+make+your+Battleline+units+dramatically+better%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EPainting+checkered+chapter+schemes+too+early%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+chunky+colour+blocks+first%2C+detail+later%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EFAQ+%E2%80%94+Space+Marines+for+Beginners%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EAre+Space+Marines+good+for+beginners%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EYes+%E2%80%94+the+best+choice.+They%27re+forgiving+in-game%2C+easy+to+build+and+paint%2C+and+every+starter+product+includes+them.+You%27ll+never+struggle+to+find+advice%2C+opponents+or+spare+models.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EHow+much+does+a+1%2C000-point+Space+Marine+army+cost%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3ERoughly+%24250%E2%80%93400+including+tools+and+paints%2C+less+if+you+start+from+a+starter+box+or+buy+second-hand.+The+starter+boxes+alone+cover+the+first+500+points.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EWhich+Space+Marine+chapter+should+I+paint%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EOne+with+a+simple+scheme%3A+a+solid+blue+%28Ultramarines-style%29%2C+green+or+red.+Save+complex+chapter+schemes+for+later+armies.+Homebrew+chapters+are+fully+legitimate+%E2%80%94+invent+your+own+colours.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EAre+Space+Marines+still+strong+in+the+current+edition%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EMarines+are+always+a+mid-to-strong%2C+well-supported+faction+%E2%80%94+Games+Workshop+balances+around+them+first.+As+a+beginner%2C+their+forgiving+durability+matters+far+more+than+meta+tier+lists.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EWhat+do+I+buy+after+the+starter+box%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EOne+box+of+Intercessors+and+one+heavy%2Fvehicle+box+gets+you+to+a+real+1%2C000+points.+Buy%2C+build%2C+paint%2C+repeat+%E2%80%94+one+box+at+a+time.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ESpace+Marines+vs.+Necrons+for+a+first+army%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EBoth+are+top+beginner+picks.+Marines+win+on+community+support+and+starter-box+availability%3B+Necrons+win+on+looks+and+fastest+paint+scheme.+Read+our+%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fbest-warhammer-40k-army-for-beginners%2F%22%3Ehead-to-head+comparison%3C%2Fa%3E.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EStart+Your+Chapter%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fhow-to-start-warhammer-40k%2F%22%3EHow+to+Start+Warhammer+40K%3A+Beginner%27s+Roadmap%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fbest-warhammer-40k-starter-set%2F%22%3EBest+Warhammer+40K+Starter+Set+in+2026+%28Compared%29%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fnecrons-beginner-army-guide%2F%22%3ENecrons+Beginner+Army+Guide%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+the+altern